  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="transcription" xml:id="transcription_aad_0163" xml:lang="en">
          <div type="letter">
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00497/" ed="1r" type="sheet"/>
            <div type="letter_message" hand="#type_black_stiebner">
              <opener>
                <seg hand="#print_bruckmann" xml:lang="de">
                  <lb/><orgName><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_xx">Bruckmann München</rs></orgName>
                  <lb/>Studio Bruckmann GmbH, 8000 München 20, Abholfach
                  <lb/>
                </seg>
                <seg hand="#print_bruckmann" xml:lang="de">
                  <lb/>Studio Bruckmann
                  <lb/>Kunst im Druck <foreign xml:lang="en">Fine Art</foreign> GmbH.
                  <lb/>
                </seg>
                <seg>
                  <persName>
                    <lb/><rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Mr. Wystan Hugh Auden</rs>
                  </persName>
                  <placeName>
                    <address>
                      <lb/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_6">Christ Church</rs> 
                      <lb/><rs type="place" ref="#amp_place_id_46"><hi rend="underline" hand="#type_black_stiebner">O X F O R D</hi> / England</rs>
                    </address>
                  </placeName>
                </seg>
                <seg hand="#print_bruckmann" xml:lang="de">
                  <lb/>Ihre Zeichen  Ihre Nachricht vom   Unsere Zeichen   Durchwahl   Tag
                </seg>
                <dateline>  
                  <date>
                    <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="43"/>March 22nd, 1973
                  </date>
                </dateline>
                <seg>
                  <lb/><hi rend="underline" hand="#type_black_bachmann">Re:</hi><space unit="char" quantity="2"/>Our editorial work "The Great Change"
                  <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="5"/>Your poem "Moonlanding"
                </seg>
                <salute>
                  <lb/>Dear <rs type="person" ref="#amp_person_1">Mr. Auden</rs>,
                </salute>
              </opener>
              <p>
                <lb/>On the basis of your approval given on July 24th, 1972,
                <lb/>we have been authorized to use your poem "Moonlanding"
                <lb/>from "Epistle to a Godson and other Poems" in the original
                <lb/>English version as well as in the German translation by
                <lb/>Herbert Zand for our book edition "The Great Change", con-
                <lb/>taining also original serigraphs and ornaments by the artist
                <lb/>Otmar Alt. The licence rights by Faber &amp; Faber Ltd., London,
                <lb/>as well as by Random House Inc., New York, for the English
                <lb/>text, and by Lindner AG, Zürich, for the German text,
                <lb/>including the translation rights of Herbert Zand, have been
                <lb/>duly obtained. Any author's rights and rights of usufruct
                <lb/>beyond those already obtained, that we do need for the purpose 
                <lb/>of our book edition, you herewith transfer to us.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>The editorial work will be published in a limited original
                <lb/>edition of 750 copies destined for sale as well as 50 copies 
                <lb/>destined for the archives and the artist. All these copies
                <lb/>shall be handsigned by yourself and the artist.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/><space unit="char" quantity="52"/>cont.
              </p>
              </div>
              <div hand="#print_bruckmann" xml:lang="de">
                <ab>
                  <lb/>8000 München 19
                  <lb/>Nymphenburger
                  <lb/>Straße 84
                </ab>
                <ab>
                  <lb/>Ruf: Sa.-Nr.1 25 71
                  <lb/>Fernverkehr
                  <lb/>Vorwähl-Nr. 08 11
                </ab>
                <ab>
                  <lb/>Telex:
                  <lb/>05-23 739
                </ab>
                <ab>
                  <lb/>Telegramme:
                  <lb/>Bruckmannkoge
                  <lb/>München
                </ab>
                <ab>
                  <lb/>Bank:
                  <lb/>Reuschel &amp; Co.
                  <lb/>319 121
                </ab>
                <ab>
                  <lb/>Geschäftsführung:
                  <lb/>Erhardt D. Stiebner Fritz Andreae
                  <lb/>Registergericht: München HRB 44 336
                </ab>
              </div>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00498/" ed="1v" type="sheet"/>
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00499/" ed="2r" type="sheet"/>
            <div type="letter_message" hand="#type_black_stiebner" xml:lang="en">
              <ab hand="#print_bruckmann" xml:lang="de">
                <lb/>Bruckmann München
                <lb/>Blatt <add hand="#type_black_stiebner" place="inline">2</add> zum Brief an <add hand="#type_black_stiebner" place="inline">Wystan Hugh Auden</add> Tag <add hand="#type_black_stiebner" place="inline"><foreign xml:lang="en">March 22nd</foreign>,1973</add>
              </ab>
              <p>
                <lb/>You have agreed to handsign the unbound and untrimmed
                <lb/>frontispieces of the aforementioned editions plus a certain
                <lb/>number of reserve copies for bookbinding at your home in
                <lb/>Oxford, on March 25th, 1973.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>As a supplementary remuneration for the assignment of the
                <lb/>copyright and, in particular, for the handsigning,
                <lb/>you shall receive a lumpsum compension of DM 6,000.oo
                <lb/>(in words: six thousand <foreign xml:lang="de">Deutschmark</foreign>) which shall become
                <lb/>due for payment upon publication of the book edition
                <lb/>(April 1973). In addition, you shall receive one of the
                <lb/>copies reserved for the archives, including the signature
                <lb/>of the artist Otmar Alt.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>All taxes due on the above-mentioned compensation shall be
                <lb/>borne by yourself.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>Additional verbal agreements do not exist.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>Place of performance and jurisdiction for this agreement
                <lb/>shall be Munich.
              </p>
              <p>
                <lb/>We would ask you to please sign this letter as a confirm-
                <lb/>ation of your agreement.
              </p>
              <closer>
                <salute>
                  <lb/><space quantity="27" unit="char"/>Sincerely yours,
                </salute>
                <signed>
                  <lb/><space quantity="27" unit="char"/><rs type="org" ref="#amp_organization_345">STUDIO BRUCKMANN GMBH</rs>
                </signed>
                  <lb/><signed hand="#hand_blue_stiebner"><unclear>St</unclear>iebner</signed> <signed hand="#hand_blue_andreae">Andrea<unclear>e</unclear></signed>
               </closer>
              <postscript>
                <p>
                  <lb/>Confirmation of approval:
                </p>
                <p>
                  <lb/>_________________________
                  <lb/>Date:
                </p>
              </postscript>
            </div>  
        <pb facs="https://iiif.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/aad/aad_00500/" ed="2v" type="sheet"/>
